{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Now With Virtual Keyboard!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Get rid of every problem in your life.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game everyone always wanted, but no one could get. And it's changed now!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keyboard Simulator is a clicker game that will help you uncover the true meaning of life. A truly deep and wonderful game with relaxing typing. Type on keyboard, get skins, type more, get more skins \u2013 do more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make all of your problems disappear by playing amazing game </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Skins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get yourself new skins every 30 minutes in game, you can even request to add your own keyboard and earn from it! These skins are all tradable and exchangable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Typing &amp; Relaxing clicker!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use it as Virtual Keyboard in your needs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many upgrades!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect all kind of skins, from an old office keyboards to the unique alien ones!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sounds of any keyboard you want when typing with game running in the background!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 1000+ skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your life with how you live!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your reaction time and try to beat the best one!</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Q","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3679380/d09e9122ced4dea88f9fdf9524cfeb162a6b3cef.jpg"},{"name":"W",